# Agent/tooling scratch trees that live at the repo root. These are untracked
# but were not ignored, so `git add -A` from the root would try to stage entire
# nested worktrees — including whatever a future session leaves inside one.
# (.opencode/ is deliberately NOT here: it is tracked config, like .claude/.)
.release-worktrees/
.codex/
